         "Metafield: product.product_about_description [multi_line_text_field]": "Skin tone and texture are keys to skin\u2019s radiance. But as we age, cell turnover decreases. We can help this natural process along by exfoliating dead skin cells so that skin\u2019s vibrance returns.\n<br><br>\nThis Skin Renewing Peel is designed to help improve skin tone and texture by sloughing off dead skin cells and revealing more radiant, younger-looking skin. Lactic acid is a known gentle method of exfoliation suitable for all skin types, especially those with normal to dry, dehydrated or sun-damaged skin. When the layer of dead skin cells is physically decreased, so is the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles. Our melon super antioxidants help protect from environmental aggressors and prevent future damage.\n<br><br>\nMassage gently onto clean, dry skin. Leave on for 5 to 10 minutes. You may feel a slight tingling sensation during or after application. Wash thoroughly with warm water.\n<br><br>\nUse once or twice a week.\n<br>\n<ul>\n<li>Increases radiance and decreases dullness</li>\n<li>Reduces appearance of fine lines and wrinkles</li>\n<li>Helps reveal renewed, more radiant skin</li>\n</ul>",
